    <node id="n49">
      <data key="d6">
        <y:UMLNoteNode>
          <y:Geometry height="420.0" width="690.4281290341123" x="-1405.2735329341317" y="2169.849700598803"/>
          <y:Fill color="#CCFFFF" transparent="false"/>
          <y:BorderStyle color="#000000" type="line" width="1.0"/>
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="left" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="14" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" height="366.29042053222656" horizontalTextPosition="center" iconTextGap="4" modelName="internal" modelPosition="l" textColor="#000000" verticalTextPosition="bottom" visible="true" width="577.8018798828125" x="4.0" xml:space="preserve" y="26.85478973388672">University position types – SKOS vocabulary vocab:it-university-position-types (ptype-it:)
- every ptype-it: concept is a ac:PositionType (⊑ org:Role ⊑ skos:Concept) and is
  skos:inScheme the scheme (drawn only for the two top concepts)
- hierarchy with skos:broader (skos:narrower in the TTL); a group may be used
  when the source gives no detail
- employment type and working-time regime are NOT in the vocabulary: they are
  properties of the Position (ac:hasEmploymentType, ac:hasRegime).
  The Cercauniversità strings, e.g. "Ricercatore a t.d. - t.pieno / t.defin.
  (art. 24 c.3-b L. 240/10)", are skos:hiddenLabel of ptype-it:rtdb; the regime
  read from the string goes into the position
- successions: dct:isReplacedBy / dct:replaces (RTDa, RTDb -&gt; RTT, 2022;
  assegno -&gt; contratto di ricerca, 2022)
- history: skos:historyNote + dct:source (law) and the period in which new
  appointments were possible (in the TTL)
- confirmation (non confermato -&gt; confermato) does not start a new Position
- research organizations: separate scheme vocab:it-epr-position-types (ptype-epr:),
  by area and profile; levels I-VIII as skos:Collection (ptype-epr:livello-i ...)
- equivalent tiers: grade-it:fascia-1, -2 (D.M. 367/2022), -3 (conventional),
  skos:Collection with members from ptype-it: and ptype-epr:</y:NodeLabel>
        </y:UMLNoteNode>
      </data>
    </node>
